tdn:ExtractedRole rdf:type owl:Class .
tdn:ExtractedRole rdfs:comment "Analyst-defined organizational superclass for realizations of the role and concept categories extracted from the CSfC MSC v1.3.0 source. Each role class denotes the entities or bearers that realize its source-context category. The categories include devices, services, aggregates, mixed authorities, and protocol functions. The root does not reproduce a CP definition and does not assert that every category is a physical device or an MSC Solution Component. Classes without a curated parent receive a generated organizational edge to the root; that edge is separate from source-backed subtype evidence." .
tdn:ExtractedRole rdfs:label "Extracted role or concept realization" .
