<urn:tdn:csfc:source:CSFC-MSC-1.3.0-4e40e3d83708:p010:f01:label003> rdfs:label "CSFC-MSC-1.3.0-4e40e3d83708:p010:f01:label003" .
<urn:tdn:csfc:source:CSFC-MSC-1.3.0-4e40e3d83708:p010:f01:label003> tdn:pdfPages "10" .
<urn:tdn:csfc:source:CSFC-MSC-1.3.0-4e40e3d83708:p010:f01:label003> tdn:sourceText "Inner Encryption Component" .
<urn:tdn:csfc:source:CSFC-MSC-1.3.0-4e40e3d83708:p010:f01:label004> rdfs:label "CSFC-MSC-1.3.0-4e40e3d83708:p010:f01:label004" .
<urn:tdn:csfc:source:CSFC-MSC-1.3.0-4e40e3d83708:p010:f01:label004> tdn:pdfPages "10" .
<urn:tdn:csfc:source:CSFC-MSC-1.3.0-4e40e3d83708:p010:f01:label004> tdn:sourceText "Outer Encryption Component" .
<urn:tdn:csfc:source:CSFC-MSC-1.3.0-4e40e3d83708:p010:f01:label006> rdfs:label "CSFC-MSC-1.3.0-4e40e3d83708:p010:f01:label006" .
<urn:tdn:csfc:source:CSFC-MSC-1.3.0-4e40e3d83708:p010:f01:label006> tdn:pdfPages "10" .
<urn:tdn:csfc:source:CSFC-MSC-1.3.0-4e40e3d83708:p010:f01:label006> tdn:sourceText "Inner Encryption Component" .
<urn:tdn:csfc:source:CSFC-MSC-1.3.0-4e40e3d83708:p010:f01:label007> rdfs:label "CSFC-MSC-1.3.0-4e40e3d83708:p010:f01:label007" .
<urn:tdn:csfc:source:CSFC-MSC-1.3.0-4e40e3d83708:p010:f01:label007> tdn:pdfPages "10" .
<urn:tdn:csfc:source:CSFC-MSC-1.3.0-4e40e3d83708:p010:f01:label007> tdn:sourceText "Outer Encryption Component" .
<urn:tdn:csfc:source:CSFC-MSC-1.3.0-4e40e3d83708:p010:u005.s002> rdfs:label "CSFC-MSC-1.3.0-4e40e3d83708:p010:u005.s002" .
<urn:tdn:csfc:source:CSFC-MSC-1.3.0-4e40e3d83708:p010:u005.s002> tdn:pdfPages "10" .
<urn:tdn:csfc:source:CSFC-MSC-1.3.0-4e40e3d83708:p010:u005.s002> tdn:sourceText "The two encryption tunnels protecting a data flow can use either Internet Protocol Security (IPsec) generated by a Virtual Private Network (VPN) Gateway or Media Access Control Security (MACsec) generated by a MACsec Device." .
<urn:tdn:csfc:source:CSFC-MSC-1.3.0-4e40e3d83708:p010:u005.s003> rdfs:label "CSFC-MSC-1.3.0-4e40e3d83708:p010:u005.s003" .
<urn:tdn:csfc:source:CSFC-MSC-1.3.0-4e40e3d83708:p010:u005.s003> tdn:pdfPages "10" .
<urn:tdn:csfc:source:CSFC-MSC-1.3.0-4e40e3d83708:p010:u005.s003> tdn:sourceText "VPN Gateways and MACsec Devices are implemented as part of the network infrastructure." .
<urn:tdn:csfc:source:CSFC-MSC-1.3.0-4e40e3d83708:p010:u006.s001> rdfs:label "CSFC-MSC-1.3.0-4e40e3d83708:p010:u006.s001" .
<urn:tdn:csfc:source:CSFC-MSC-1.3.0-4e40e3d83708:p010:u006.s001> tdn:pdfPages "10" .
<urn:tdn:csfc:source:CSFC-MSC-1.3.0-4e40e3d83708:p010:u006.s001> tdn:sourceText "Throughout this CP, the term “Encryption Component” refers generically to either a VPN Gateway or a MACsec Device." .
<urn:tdn:csfc:source:CSFC-MSC-1.3.0-4e40e3d83708:p010:u006.s002> rdfs:label "CSFC-MSC-1.3.0-4e40e3d83708:p010:u006.s002" .
<urn:tdn:csfc:source:CSFC-MSC-1.3.0-4e40e3d83708:p010:u006.s002> tdn:pdfPages "10" .
<urn:tdn:csfc:source:CSFC-MSC-1.3.0-4e40e3d83708:p010:u006.s002> tdn:sourceText "“Inner Encryption Component” refers to the component that terminates the Inner layer of encryption and “Outer Encryption Component” refers to the component that terminates the Outer layer of encryption." .
<urn:tdn:csfc:source:CSFC-MSC-1.3.0-4e40e3d83708:p010:u007.s001> rdfs:label "CSFC-MSC-1.3.0-4e40e3d83708:p010:u007.s001" .
<urn:tdn:csfc:source:CSFC-MSC-1.3.0-4e40e3d83708:p010:u007.s001> tdn:pdfPages "10" .
<urn:tdn:csfc:source:CSFC-MSC-1.3.0-4e40e3d83708:p010:u007.s001> tdn:sourceText "As shown in Figure 1, before being sent across the untrusted network, each packet or frame of classified data is encrypted twice; first by an Inner Encryption Component, and then by an Outer Encryption Component." .
<urn:tdn:csfc:source:CSFC-MSC-1.3.0-4e40e3d83708:p010:u007.s002> rdfs:label "CSFC-MSC-1.3.0-4e40e3d83708:p010:u007.s002" .
<urn:tdn:csfc:source:CSFC-MSC-1.3.0-4e40e3d83708:p010:u007.s002> tdn:pdfPages "10" .
<urn:tdn:csfc:source:CSFC-MSC-1.3.0-4e40e3d83708:p010:u007.s002> tdn:sourceText "At the other end of the data flow, the received packet is correspondingly decrypted twice; first by an Outer Encryption Component, and then by an Inner Encryption Component." .
<urn:tdn:csfc:source:CSFC-MSC-1.3.0-4e40e3d83708:p011:u005.s002> rdfs:label "CSFC-MSC-1.3.0-4e40e3d83708:p011:u005.s002" .
<urn:tdn:csfc:source:CSFC-MSC-1.3.0-4e40e3d83708:p011:u005.s002> tdn:pdfPages "11" .
<urn:tdn:csfc:source:CSFC-MSC-1.3.0-4e40e3d83708:p011:u005.s002> tdn:sourceText "The Red Network is logically located behind an Inner Encryption Component." .
<urn:tdn:csfc:source:CSFC-MSC-1.3.0-4e40e3d83708:p011:u005.s005> rdfs:label "CSFC-MSC-1.3.0-4e40e3d83708:p011:u005.s005" .
<urn:tdn:csfc:source:CSFC-MSC-1.3.0-4e40e3d83708:p011:u005.s005> tdn:pdfPages "11" .
<urn:tdn:csfc:source:CSFC-MSC-1.3.0-4e40e3d83708:p011:u005.s005> tdn:sourceText "Red Networks are under the control of the Solution Owner or a trusted third party using a Red Administrative Workstation (AW)." .
<urn:tdn:csfc:source:CSFC-MSC-1.3.0-4e40e3d83708:p011:u005.s006> rdfs:label "CSFC-MSC-1.3.0-4e40e3d83708:p011:u005.s006" .
<urn:tdn:csfc:source:CSFC-MSC-1.3.0-4e40e3d83708:p011:u005.s006> tdn:pdfPages "11" .
<urn:tdn:csfc:source:CSFC-MSC-1.3.0-4e40e3d83708:p011:u005.s006> tdn:sourceText "The Red AWs maintain, monitor, and control all security functions for the Inner Encryption Components, Inner Firewall, and all Red Management Service Components." .
<urn:tdn:csfc:source:CSFC-MSC-1.3.0-4e40e3d83708:p011:u005.s007> rdfs:label "CSFC-MSC-1.3.0-4e40e3d83708:p011:u005.s007" .
<urn:tdn:csfc:source:CSFC-MSC-1.3.0-4e40e3d83708:p011:u005.s007> tdn:pdfPages "11" .
<urn:tdn:csfc:source:CSFC-MSC-1.3.0-4e40e3d83708:p011:u005.s007> tdn:sourceText "The Red AWs are not permitted to maintain, monitor, or control Outer Encryption Components or Gray Management Services." .
<urn:tdn:csfc:source:CSFC-MSC-1.3.0-4e40e3d83708:p011:u007.s002> rdfs:label "CSFC-MSC-1.3.0-4e40e3d83708:p011:u007.s002" .
<urn:tdn:csfc:source:CSFC-MSC-1.3.0-4e40e3d83708:p011:u007.s002> tdn:pdfPages "11" .
<urn:tdn:csfc:source:CSFC-MSC-1.3.0-4e40e3d83708:p011:u007.s002> tdn:sourceText "Gray Networks are composed of Gray data and Gray Management Services." .
<urn:tdn:csfc:source:CSFC-MSC-1.3.0-4e40e3d83708:p011:u009.s001> rdfs:label "CSFC-MSC-1.3.0-4e40e3d83708:p011:u009.s001" .
<urn:tdn:csfc:source:CSFC-MSC-1.3.0-4e40e3d83708:p011:u009.s001> tdn:pdfPages "11" .
<urn:tdn:csfc:source:CSFC-MSC-1.3.0-4e40e3d83708:p011:u009.s001> tdn:sourceText "Gray Network components consist of the Outer Encryption Component, Gray Firewall, and Gray Management Services." .
<urn:tdn:csfc:source:CSFC-MSC-1.3.0-4e40e3d83708:p011:u009.s003> rdfs:label "CSFC-MSC-1.3.0-4e40e3d83708:p011:u009.s003" .
<urn:tdn:csfc:source:CSFC-MSC-1.3.0-4e40e3d83708:p011:u009.s003> tdn:pdfPages "11" .
<urn:tdn:csfc:source:CSFC-MSC-1.3.0-4e40e3d83708:p011:u009.s003> tdn:sourceText "Gray Management Services are physically connected to the Gray Firewall and include, at a minimum, a AW that can be a physical workstation or Virtual Machine (VM)." .
<urn:tdn:csfc:source:CSFC-MSC-1.3.0-4e40e3d83708:p011:u009.s004> rdfs:label "CSFC-MSC-1.3.0-4e40e3d83708:p011:u009.s004" .
<urn:tdn:csfc:source:CSFC-MSC-1.3.0-4e40e3d83708:p011:u009.s004> tdn:pdfPages "11" .
<urn:tdn:csfc:source:CSFC-MSC-1.3.0-4e40e3d83708:p011:u009.s004> tdn:sourceText "The Gray Management Services may also include a Security Information and Event Management (SIEM) unless the SIEM is implemented in the Red Network in conjunction with a cross domain solution (CDS) (see CSfC Continuous Monitoring Annex)." .
<urn:tdn:csfc:source:CSFC-MSC-1.3.0-4e40e3d83708:p011:u009.s005> rdfs:label "CSFC-MSC-1.3.0-4e40e3d83708:p011:u009.s005" .
<urn:tdn:csfc:source:CSFC-MSC-1.3.0-4e40e3d83708:p011:u009.s005> tdn:pdfPages "11" .
<urn:tdn:csfc:source:CSFC-MSC-1.3.0-4e40e3d83708:p011:u009.s005> tdn:sourceText "This CP requires the management of Gray Network components through a Gray AW." .
<urn:tdn:csfc:source:CSFC-MSC-1.3.0-4e40e3d83708:p011:u009.s006> rdfs:label "CSFC-MSC-1.3.0-4e40e3d83708:p011:u009.s006" .
<urn:tdn:csfc:source:CSFC-MSC-1.3.0-4e40e3d83708:p011:u009.s006> tdn:pdfPages "11" .
<urn:tdn:csfc:source:CSFC-MSC-1.3.0-4e40e3d83708:p011:u009.s006> tdn:sourceText "As a result, neither Red nor Black AWs are permitted to manage the Outer Encryption Component, Gray Firewall, or Gray Management Services." .
<urn:tdn:csfc:source:CSFC-MSC-1.3.0-4e40e3d83708:p011:u009.s007> rdfs:label "CSFC-MSC-1.3.0-4e40e3d83708:p011:u009.s007" .
<urn:tdn:csfc:source:CSFC-MSC-1.3.0-4e40e3d83708:p011:u009.s007> tdn:pdfPages "11, 12" .
<urn:tdn:csfc:source:CSFC-MSC-1.3.0-4e40e3d83708:p011:u009.s007> tdn:sourceText "Additionally, the Gray AWs are prohibited from managing Inner Encryption Components." .
<urn:tdn:csfc:source:CSFC-MSC-1.3.0-4e40e3d83708:p012:f02:label004> rdfs:label "CSFC-MSC-1.3.0-4e40e3d83708:p012:f02:label004" .
<urn:tdn:csfc:source:CSFC-MSC-1.3.0-4e40e3d83708:p012:f02:label004> tdn:pdfPages "12" .
<urn:tdn:csfc:source:CSFC-MSC-1.3.0-4e40e3d83708:p012:f02:label004> tdn:sourceText "Inner Encryption Component" .
<urn:tdn:csfc:source:CSFC-MSC-1.3.0-4e40e3d83708:p012:f02:label005> rdfs:label "CSFC-MSC-1.3.0-4e40e3d83708:p012:f02:label005" .
<urn:tdn:csfc:source:CSFC-MSC-1.3.0-4e40e3d83708:p012:f02:label005> tdn:pdfPages "12" .
<urn:tdn:csfc:source:CSFC-MSC-1.3.0-4e40e3d83708:p012:f02:label005> tdn:sourceText "Outer Encryption Component" .
<urn:tdn:csfc:source:CSFC-MSC-1.3.0-4e40e3d83708:p012:f02:label006> rdfs:label "CSFC-MSC-1.3.0-4e40e3d83708:p012:f02:label006" .
<urn:tdn:csfc:source:CSFC-MSC-1.3.0-4e40e3d83708:p012:f02:label006> tdn:pdfPages "12" .
<urn:tdn:csfc:source:CSFC-MSC-1.3.0-4e40e3d83708:p012:f02:label006> tdn:sourceText "Outer Firewall" .
<urn:tdn:csfc:source:CSFC-MSC-1.3.0-4e40e3d83708:p012:f02:label008> rdfs:label "CSFC-MSC-1.3.0-4e40e3d83708:p012:f02:label008" .
<urn:tdn:csfc:source:CSFC-MSC-1.3.0-4e40e3d83708:p012:f02:label008> tdn:pdfPages "12" .
<urn:tdn:csfc:source:CSFC-MSC-1.3.0-4e40e3d83708:p012:f02:label008> tdn:sourceText "Inner Encryption Component" .
<urn:tdn:csfc:source:CSFC-MSC-1.3.0-4e40e3d83708:p012:f02:label009> rdfs:label "CSFC-MSC-1.3.0-4e40e3d83708:p012:f02:label009" .
<urn:tdn:csfc:source:CSFC-MSC-1.3.0-4e40e3d83708:p012:f02:label009> tdn:pdfPages "12" .
<urn:tdn:csfc:source:CSFC-MSC-1.3.0-4e40e3d83708:p012:f02:label009> tdn:sourceText "Outer Encryption Component" .
<urn:tdn:csfc:source:CSFC-MSC-1.3.0-4e40e3d83708:p012:f02:label010> rdfs:label "CSFC-MSC-1.3.0-4e40e3d83708:p012:f02:label010" .
<urn:tdn:csfc:source:CSFC-MSC-1.3.0-4e40e3d83708:p012:f02:label010> tdn:pdfPages "12" .
<urn:tdn:csfc:source:CSFC-MSC-1.3.0-4e40e3d83708:p012:f02:label010> tdn:sourceText "Outer Firewall" .
<urn:tdn:csfc:source:CSFC-MSC-1.3.0-4e40e3d83708:p012:u001.s002> rdfs:label "CSFC-MSC-1.3.0-4e40e3d83708:p012:u001.s002" .
<urn:tdn:csfc:source:CSFC-MSC-1.3.0-4e40e3d83708:p012:u001.s002> tdn:pdfPages "12" .
<urn:tdn:csfc:source:CSFC-MSC-1.3.0-4e40e3d83708:p012:u001.s002> tdn:sourceText "Inner Encryption Components must be managed from a Red AW." .
<urn:tdn:csfc:source:CSFC-MSC-1.3.0-4e40e3d83708:p012:u003.s002> rdfs:label "CSFC-MSC-1.3.0-4e40e3d83708:p012:u003.s002" .
<urn:tdn:csfc:source:CSFC-MSC-1.3.0-4e40e3d83708:p012:u003.s002> tdn:pdfPages "12" .
<urn:tdn:csfc:source:CSFC-MSC-1.3.0-4e40e3d83708:p012:u003.s002> tdn:sourceText "The network connecting the Outer Encryption Components together is a Black Network." .
<urn:tdn:csfc:source:CSFC-MSC-1.3.0-4e40e3d83708:p012:u003.s005> rdfs:label "CSFC-MSC-1.3.0-4e40e3d83708:p012:u003.s005" .
<urn:tdn:csfc:source:CSFC-MSC-1.3.0-4e40e3d83708:p012:u003.s005> tdn:pdfPages "12" .
<urn:tdn:csfc:source:CSFC-MSC-1.3.0-4e40e3d83708:p012:u003.s005> tdn:sourceText "As shown in Figure 2, if the Black Network is an untrusted network such as the Public Internet, an Outer Firewall is required between the Black Network and the Outer Encryption Component." .
<urn:tdn:csfc:source:CSFC-MSC-1.3.0-4e40e3d83708:p012:u007.s001> rdfs:label "CSFC-MSC-1.3.0-4e40e3d83708:p012:u007.s001" .
<urn:tdn:csfc:source:CSFC-MSC-1.3.0-4e40e3d83708:p012:u007.s001> tdn:pdfPages "12" .
<urn:tdn:csfc:source:CSFC-MSC-1.3.0-4e40e3d83708:p012:u007.s001> tdn:sourceText "Management plane traffic is used to configure and monitor Solution Components." .
<urn:tdn:csfc:source:CSFC-MSC-1.3.0-4e40e3d83708:p012:u007.s002> rdfs:label "CSFC-MSC-1.3.0-4e40e3d83708:p012:u007.s002" .
<urn:tdn:csfc:source:CSFC-MSC-1.3.0-4e40e3d83708:p012:u007.s002> tdn:pdfPages "12" .
<urn:tdn:csfc:source:CSFC-MSC-1.3.0-4e40e3d83708:p012:u007.s002> tdn:sourceText "It includes the communications between a system administrator and a component, as well as the logs and other status information forwarded from a Solution Component to a SIEM, or similar repository." .
<urn:tdn:csfc:source:CSFC-MSC-1.3.0-4e40e3d83708:p013:u006.s005> rdfs:label "CSFC-MSC-1.3.0-4e40e3d83708:p013:u006.s005" .
<urn:tdn:csfc:source:CSFC-MSC-1.3.0-4e40e3d83708:p013:u006.s005> tdn:pdfPages "13" .
<urn:tdn:csfc:source:CSFC-MSC-1.3.0-4e40e3d83708:p013:u006.s005> tdn:sourceText "Restrictions are also placed on control plane traffic for the Outer Encryption Component." .
<urn:tdn:csfc:source:CSFC-MSC-1.3.0-4e40e3d83708:p013:u006.s006> rdfs:label "CSFC-MSC-1.3.0-4e40e3d83708:p013:u006.s006" .
<urn:tdn:csfc:source:CSFC-MSC-1.3.0-4e40e3d83708:p013:u006.s006> tdn:pdfPages "13" .
<urn:tdn:csfc:source:CSFC-MSC-1.3.0-4e40e3d83708:p013:u006.s006> tdn:sourceText "The Outer Encryption Component is prohibited from implementing routing protocols on external and internal interfaces." .
<urn:tdn:csfc:source:CSFC-MSC-1.3.0-4e40e3d83708:p013:u006.s007> rdfs:label "CSFC-MSC-1.3.0-4e40e3d83708:p013:u006.s007" .
<urn:tdn:csfc:source:CSFC-MSC-1.3.0-4e40e3d83708:p013:u006.s007> tdn:pdfPages "13" .
<urn:tdn:csfc:source:CSFC-MSC-1.3.0-4e40e3d83708:p013:u006.s007> tdn:sourceText "The Outer Encryption Component may not perform routing functionality." .
<urn:tdn:csfc:source:CSFC-MSC-1.3.0-4e40e3d83708:p013:u006.s008> rdfs:label "CSFC-MSC-1.3.0-4e40e3d83708:p013:u006.s008" .
<urn:tdn:csfc:source:CSFC-MSC-1.3.0-4e40e3d83708:p013:u006.s008> tdn:pdfPages "13" .
<urn:tdn:csfc:source:CSFC-MSC-1.3.0-4e40e3d83708:p013:u006.s008> tdn:sourceText "If an Outer Firewall is present, the Outer Firewall can perform routing functions." .
<urn:tdn:csfc:source:CSFC-MSC-1.3.0-4e40e3d83708:p014:f03:label005> rdfs:label "CSFC-MSC-1.3.0-4e40e3d83708:p014:f03:label005" .
<urn:tdn:csfc:source:CSFC-MSC-1.3.0-4e40e3d83708:p014:f03:label005> tdn:pdfPages "14" .
<urn:tdn:csfc:source:CSFC-MSC-1.3.0-4e40e3d83708:p014:f03:label005> tdn:sourceText "Inner Encryption Component" .
<urn:tdn:csfc:source:CSFC-MSC-1.3.0-4e40e3d83708:p014:f03:label006> rdfs:label "CSFC-MSC-1.3.0-4e40e3d83708:p014:f03:label006" .
<urn:tdn:csfc:source:CSFC-MSC-1.3.0-4e40e3d83708:p014:f03:label006> tdn:pdfPages "14" .
<urn:tdn:csfc:source:CSFC-MSC-1.3.0-4e40e3d83708:p014:f03:label006> tdn:sourceText "Red Management Services" .
<urn:tdn:csfc:source:CSFC-MSC-1.3.0-4e40e3d83708:p014:f03:label007> rdfs:label "CSFC-MSC-1.3.0-4e40e3d83708:p014:f03:label007" .
<urn:tdn:csfc:source:CSFC-MSC-1.3.0-4e40e3d83708:p014:f03:label007> tdn:pdfPages "14" .
<urn:tdn:csfc:source:CSFC-MSC-1.3.0-4e40e3d83708:p014:f03:label007> tdn:sourceText "Outer Encryption Component" .
<urn:tdn:csfc:source:CSFC-MSC-1.3.0-4e40e3d83708:p014:f03:label008> rdfs:label "CSFC-MSC-1.3.0-4e40e3d83708:p014:f03:label008" .
<urn:tdn:csfc:source:CSFC-MSC-1.3.0-4e40e3d83708:p014:f03:label008> tdn:pdfPages "14" .
<urn:tdn:csfc:source:CSFC-MSC-1.3.0-4e40e3d83708:p014:f03:label008> tdn:sourceText "Gray Management Services" .
<urn:tdn:csfc:source:CSFC-MSC-1.3.0-4e40e3d83708:p014:f03:label010> rdfs:label "CSFC-MSC-1.3.0-4e40e3d83708:p014:f03:label010" .
<urn:tdn:csfc:source:CSFC-MSC-1.3.0-4e40e3d83708:p014:f03:label010> tdn:pdfPages "14" .
<urn:tdn:csfc:source:CSFC-MSC-1.3.0-4e40e3d83708:p014:f03:label010> tdn:sourceText "Inner Encryption Component" .
<urn:tdn:csfc:source:CSFC-MSC-1.3.0-4e40e3d83708:p014:f03:label011> rdfs:label "CSFC-MSC-1.3.0-4e40e3d83708:p014:f03:label011" .
<urn:tdn:csfc:source:CSFC-MSC-1.3.0-4e40e3d83708:p014:f03:label011> tdn:pdfPages "14" .
<urn:tdn:csfc:source:CSFC-MSC-1.3.0-4e40e3d83708:p014:f03:label011> tdn:sourceText "Red Management Services" .
<urn:tdn:csfc:source:CSFC-MSC-1.3.0-4e40e3d83708:p014:f03:label012> rdfs:label "CSFC-MSC-1.3.0-4e40e3d83708:p014:f03:label012" .
<urn:tdn:csfc:source:CSFC-MSC-1.3.0-4e40e3d83708:p014:f03:label012> tdn:pdfPages "14" .
<urn:tdn:csfc:source:CSFC-MSC-1.3.0-4e40e3d83708:p014:f03:label012> tdn:sourceText "Outer Encryption Component" .
<urn:tdn:csfc:source:CSFC-MSC-1.3.0-4e40e3d83708:p014:f03:label013> rdfs:label "CSFC-MSC-1.3.0-4e40e3d83708:p014:f03:label013" .
<urn:tdn:csfc:source:CSFC-MSC-1.3.0-4e40e3d83708:p014:f03:label013> tdn:pdfPages "14" .
<urn:tdn:csfc:source:CSFC-MSC-1.3.0-4e40e3d83708:p014:f03:label013> tdn:sourceText "Gray Management Services" .
<urn:tdn:csfc:source:CSFC-MSC-1.3.0-4e40e3d83708:p014:u001.s002> rdfs:label "CSFC-MSC-1.3.0-4e40e3d83708:p014:u001.s002" .
<urn:tdn:csfc:source:CSFC-MSC-1.3.0-4e40e3d83708:p014:u001.s002> tdn:pdfPages "14" .
<urn:tdn:csfc:source:CSFC-MSC-1.3.0-4e40e3d83708:p014:u001.s002> tdn:sourceText "Here, each Red Network has two Encryption Components associated with it; an Inner Encryption Component connected to the Red Network, and an Outer Encryption Component between the Inner Encryption Component and the Black Network." .
<urn:tdn:csfc:source:CSFC-MSC-1.3.0-4e40e3d83708:p014:u002.s001> rdfs:label "CSFC-MSC-1.3.0-4e40e3d83708:p014:u002.s001" .
<urn:tdn:csfc:source:CSFC-MSC-1.3.0-4e40e3d83708:p014:u002.s001> tdn:pdfPages "14" .
<urn:tdn:csfc:source:CSFC-MSC-1.3.0-4e40e3d83708:p014:u002.s001> tdn:sourceText "There are two layers of encryption tunnels between any pair of sites communicating directly with one another; one encryption tunnel between their Outer Encryption Components, and a second encryption tunnel between their Inner Encryption Components." .
<urn:tdn:csfc:source:CSFC-MSC-1.3.0-4e40e3d83708:p014:u002.s002> rdfs:label "CSFC-MSC-1.3.0-4e40e3d83708:p014:u002.s002" .
<urn:tdn:csfc:source:CSFC-MSC-1.3.0-4e40e3d83708:p014:u002.s002> tdn:pdfPages "14" .
<urn:tdn:csfc:source:CSFC-MSC-1.3.0-4e40e3d83708:p014:u002.s002> tdn:sourceText "Each set of Inner or Outer Encryption Components can provide encryption using either IPsec or MACsec." .
<urn:tdn:csfc:source:CSFC-MSC-1.3.0-4e40e3d83708:p014:u006.s001> rdfs:label "CSFC-MSC-1.3.0-4e40e3d83708:p014:u006.s001" .
<urn:tdn:csfc:source:CSFC-MSC-1.3.0-4e40e3d83708:p014:u006.s001> tdn:pdfPages "14" .
<urn:tdn:csfc:source:CSFC-MSC-1.3.0-4e40e3d83708:p014:u006.s001> tdn:sourceText "For independently managed sites, each site performs the administration of its own Encryption Components." .
<urn:tdn:csfc:source:CSFC-MSC-1.3.0-4e40e3d83708:p014:u006.s002> rdfs:label "CSFC-MSC-1.3.0-4e40e3d83708:p014:u006.s002" .
<urn:tdn:csfc:source:CSFC-MSC-1.3.0-4e40e3d83708:p014:u006.s002> tdn:pdfPages "14" .
<urn:tdn:csfc:source:CSFC-MSC-1.3.0-4e40e3d83708:p014:u006.s002> tdn:sourceText "If Certification Authorities (CAs) are part of the MSC Solution, each site has the option to use either locally run CAs that they manage and control or, where available, enterprise CAs that are not necessarily managed by the Solution Owner." .
<urn:tdn:csfc:source:CSFC-MSC-1.3.0-4e40e3d83708:p014:u006.s003> rdfs:label "CSFC-MSC-1.3.0-4e40e3d83708:p014:u006.s003" .
<urn:tdn:csfc:source:CSFC-MSC-1.3.0-4e40e3d83708:p014:u006.s003> tdn:pdfPages "14" .
<urn:tdn:csfc:source:CSFC-MSC-1.3.0-4e40e3d83708:p014:u006.s003> tdn:sourceText "Each site needs to ensure that the Encryption Components selected interoperate with those at the other sites." .
<urn:tdn:csfc:source:CSFC-MSC-1.3.0-4e40e3d83708:p014:u007.s002> rdfs:label "CSFC-MSC-1.3.0-4e40e3d83708:p014:u007.s002" .
<urn:tdn:csfc:source:CSFC-MSC-1.3.0-4e40e3d83708:p014:u007.s002> tdn:pdfPages "14" .
<urn:tdn:csfc:source:CSFC-MSC-1.3.0-4e40e3d83708:p014:u007.s002> tdn:sourceText "In the MSC Solution, Encryption Components at each site using public key certificates need to have the signing certificates and revocation information for the corresponding CAs used by the other sites." .
<urn:tdn:csfc:source:CSFC-MSC-1.3.0-4e40e3d83708:p014:u007.s003> rdfs:label "CSFC-MSC-1.3.0-4e40e3d83708:p014:u007.s003" .
<urn:tdn:csfc:source:CSFC-MSC-1.3.0-4e40e3d83708:p014:u007.s003> tdn:pdfPages "14" .
<urn:tdn:csfc:source:CSFC-MSC-1.3.0-4e40e3d83708:p014:u007.s003> tdn:sourceText "This high-level design requires cooperation between the various sites in the solution to ensure that all CAs used by each site are trusted at all the other sites." .
<urn:tdn:csfc:source:CSFC-MSC-1.3.0-4e40e3d83708:p014:u007.s004> rdfs:label "CSFC-MSC-1.3.0-4e40e3d83708:p014:u007.s004" .
<urn:tdn:csfc:source:CSFC-MSC-1.3.0-4e40e3d83708:p014:u007.s004> tdn:pdfPages "14" .
<urn:tdn:csfc:source:CSFC-MSC-1.3.0-4e40e3d83708:p014:u007.s004> tdn:sourceText "Similarly, MACsec Devices using a Connectivity Association Key (CAK) need to have the same CAK used by the other site in the MSC Solution." .
<urn:tdn:csfc:source:CSFC-MSC-1.3.0-4e40e3d83708:p014:u007.s005> rdfs:label "CSFC-MSC-1.3.0-4e40e3d83708:p014:u007.s005" .
<urn:tdn:csfc:source:CSFC-MSC-1.3.0-4e40e3d83708:p014:u007.s005> tdn:pdfPages "14" .
<urn:tdn:csfc:source:CSFC-MSC-1.3.0-4e40e3d83708:p014:u007.s005> tdn:sourceText "If MACsec Devices are authenticating using certificates, the authentication server (AS) must not connect to both Gray and/or Red Networks." .
<urn:tdn:csfc:source:CSFC-MSC-1.3.0-4e40e3d83708:p015:f04:label006> rdfs:label "CSFC-MSC-1.3.0-4e40e3d83708:p015:f04:label006" .
<urn:tdn:csfc:source:CSFC-MSC-1.3.0-4e40e3d83708:p015:f04:label006> tdn:pdfPages "15" .
<urn:tdn:csfc:source:CSFC-MSC-1.3.0-4e40e3d83708:p015:f04:label006> tdn:sourceText "Inner Encryption Component" .
<urn:tdn:csfc:source:CSFC-MSC-1.3.0-4e40e3d83708:p015:f04:label007> rdfs:label "CSFC-MSC-1.3.0-4e40e3d83708:p015:f04:label007" .
<urn:tdn:csfc:source:CSFC-MSC-1.3.0-4e40e3d83708:p015:f04:label007> tdn:pdfPages "15" .
<urn:tdn:csfc:source:CSFC-MSC-1.3.0-4e40e3d83708:p015:f04:label007> tdn:sourceText "Red Management Services" .
<urn:tdn:csfc:source:CSFC-MSC-1.3.0-4e40e3d83708:p015:f04:label008> rdfs:label "CSFC-MSC-1.3.0-4e40e3d83708:p015:f04:label008" .
<urn:tdn:csfc:source:CSFC-MSC-1.3.0-4e40e3d83708:p015:f04:label008> tdn:pdfPages "15" .
<urn:tdn:csfc:source:CSFC-MSC-1.3.0-4e40e3d83708:p015:f04:label008> tdn:sourceText "Outer Encryption Component" .
<urn:tdn:csfc:source:CSFC-MSC-1.3.0-4e40e3d83708:p015:f04:label009> rdfs:label "CSFC-MSC-1.3.0-4e40e3d83708:p015:f04:label009" .
<urn:tdn:csfc:source:CSFC-MSC-1.3.0-4e40e3d83708:p015:f04:label009> tdn:pdfPages "15" .
<urn:tdn:csfc:source:CSFC-MSC-1.3.0-4e40e3d83708:p015:f04:label009> tdn:sourceText "Gray Management Services" .
<urn:tdn:csfc:source:CSFC-MSC-1.3.0-4e40e3d83708:p015:f04:label011> rdfs:label "CSFC-MSC-1.3.0-4e40e3d83708:p015:f04:label011" .
<urn:tdn:csfc:source:CSFC-MSC-1.3.0-4e40e3d83708:p015:f04:label011> tdn:pdfPages "15" .
<urn:tdn:csfc:source:CSFC-MSC-1.3.0-4e40e3d83708:p015:f04:label011> tdn:sourceText "Inner Encryption Component" .
<urn:tdn:csfc:source:CSFC-MSC-1.3.0-4e40e3d83708:p015:f04:label012> rdfs:label "CSFC-MSC-1.3.0-4e40e3d83708:p015:f04:label012" .
<urn:tdn:csfc:source:CSFC-MSC-1.3.0-4e40e3d83708:p015:f04:label012> tdn:pdfPages "15" .
<urn:tdn:csfc:source:CSFC-MSC-1.3.0-4e40e3d83708:p015:f04:label012> tdn:sourceText "Outer Encryption Component" .
<urn:tdn:csfc:source:CSFC-MSC-1.3.0-4e40e3d83708:p015:u002.s003> rdfs:label "CSFC-MSC-1.3.0-4e40e3d83708:p015:u002.s003" .
<urn:tdn:csfc:source:CSFC-MSC-1.3.0-4e40e3d83708:p015:u002.s003> tdn:pdfPages "15" .
<urn:tdn:csfc:source:CSFC-MSC-1.3.0-4e40e3d83708:p015:u002.s003> tdn:sourceText "At least two CAs are needed; one for all the Inner Encryption Components and one for all the Outer Encryption Components." .
<urn:tdn:csfc:source:CSFC-MSC-1.3.0-4e40e3d83708:p015:u002.s004> rdfs:label "CSFC-MSC-1.3.0-4e40e3d83708:p015:u002.s004" .
<urn:tdn:csfc:source:CSFC-MSC-1.3.0-4e40e3d83708:p015:u002.s004> tdn:pdfPages "15" .
<urn:tdn:csfc:source:CSFC-MSC-1.3.0-4e40e3d83708:p015:u002.s004> tdn:sourceText "If available, enterprise CAs should be used." .
<urn:tdn:csfc:source:CSFC-MSC-1.3.0-4e40e3d83708:p015:u002.s005> rdfs:label "CSFC-MSC-1.3.0-4e40e3d83708:p015:u002.s005" .
<urn:tdn:csfc:source:CSFC-MSC-1.3.0-4e40e3d83708:p015:u002.s005> tdn:pdfPages "15" .
<urn:tdn:csfc:source:CSFC-MSC-1.3.0-4e40e3d83708:p015:u002.s005> tdn:sourceText "If MACsec Devices are used on either or both layers and EAP-TLS is used for authentication, then CAs and an AS located at the Central site are required, otherwise, PSKs may be used for authentication for one of the layers of the solution and that layer would not require a CA." .
<urn:tdn:csfc:source:CSFC-MSC-1.3.0-4e40e3d83708:p015:u004.s001> rdfs:label "CSFC-MSC-1.3.0-4e40e3d83708:p015:u004.s001" .
<urn:tdn:csfc:source:CSFC-MSC-1.3.0-4e40e3d83708:p015:u004.s001> tdn:pdfPages "15" .
<urn:tdn:csfc:source:CSFC-MSC-1.3.0-4e40e3d83708:p015:u004.s001> tdn:sourceText "Because the central management site manages the Encryption Components at the other sites over the network, encryption is used to logically separate data and management traffic as it passes between sites." .
<urn:tdn:csfc:source:CSFC-MSC-1.3.0-4e40e3d83708:p015:u004.s003> rdfs:label "CSFC-MSC-1.3.0-4e40e3d83708:p015:u004.s003" .
<urn:tdn:csfc:source:CSFC-MSC-1.3.0-4e40e3d83708:p015:u004.s003> tdn:pdfPages "15" .
<urn:tdn:csfc:source:CSFC-MSC-1.3.0-4e40e3d83708:p015:u004.s003> tdn:sourceText "Red management traffic is encrypted before being routed through the Inner and Outer Encryption Components to another site." .
<urn:tdn:csfc:source:CSFC-MSC-1.3.0-4e40e3d83708:p015:u007.s004> rdfs:label "CSFC-MSC-1.3.0-4e40e3d83708:p015:u007.s004" .
<urn:tdn:csfc:source:CSFC-MSC-1.3.0-4e40e3d83708:p015:u007.s004> tdn:pdfPages "15" .
<urn:tdn:csfc:source:CSFC-MSC-1.3.0-4e40e3d83708:p015:u007.s004> tdn:sourceText "Although each Red Network requires its own Inner Encryption Component, a site may use a single Outer Encryption Component to encrypt and transport traffic that has been encrypted by Inner Encryption Components of varying security levels." .
<urn:tdn:csfc:source:CSFC-MSC-1.3.0-4e40e3d83708:p016:u001.s002> rdfs:label "CSFC-MSC-1.3.0-4e40e3d83708:p016:u001.s002" .
<urn:tdn:csfc:source:CSFC-MSC-1.3.0-4e40e3d83708:p016:u001.s002> tdn:pdfPages "16" .
<urn:tdn:csfc:source:CSFC-MSC-1.3.0-4e40e3d83708:p016:u001.s002> tdn:sourceText "An unclassified network can also be included behind the Outer Encryption Component but must be behind its own Inner Encryption Component and meet the requirements in this CP as if it was a Red Network." .
<urn:tdn:csfc:source:CSFC-MSC-1.3.0-4e40e3d83708:p016:u002.s008> rdfs:label "CSFC-MSC-1.3.0-4e40e3d83708:p016:u002.s008" .
<urn:tdn:csfc:source:CSFC-MSC-1.3.0-4e40e3d83708:p016:u002.s008> tdn:pdfPages "16" .
<urn:tdn:csfc:source:CSFC-MSC-1.3.0-4e40e3d83708:p016:u002.s008> tdn:sourceText "Given both cases, separate CAs, CAKs, and management devices are needed to manage the Inner Encryption Components at each security level." .
<urn:tdn:csfc:source:CSFC-MSC-1.3.0-4e40e3d83708:p016:u002.s009> rdfs:label "CSFC-MSC-1.3.0-4e40e3d83708:p016:u002.s009" .
<urn:tdn:csfc:source:CSFC-MSC-1.3.0-4e40e3d83708:p016:u002.s009> tdn:pdfPages "16" .
<urn:tdn:csfc:source:CSFC-MSC-1.3.0-4e40e3d83708:p016:u002.s009> tdn:sourceText "For example, Figure 5 shows a Central Management Site (Site A) and a Remote Site (Site B), but network 1 and network 2 each has its own Red Management Services, which prevents the Inner Encryption Components of the two networks from being able to authenticate with one another." .
<urn:tdn:csfc:source:CSFC-MSC-1.3.0-4e40e3d83708:p016:u004.s001> rdfs:label "CSFC-MSC-1.3.0-4e40e3d83708:p016:u004.s001" .
<urn:tdn:csfc:source:CSFC-MSC-1.3.0-4e40e3d83708:p016:u004.s001> tdn:pdfPages "16" .
<urn:tdn:csfc:source:CSFC-MSC-1.3.0-4e40e3d83708:p016:u004.s001> tdn:sourceText "When Red Networks that operate at the same security level are implemented, the cryptographic separation provided by the Inner Encryption Components is sufficient to protect against unintended data flows between the two networks." .
<urn:tdn:csfc:source:CSFC-MSC-1.3.0-4e40e3d83708:p016:u004.s002> rdfs:label "CSFC-MSC-1.3.0-4e40e3d83708:p016:u004.s002" .
<urn:tdn:csfc:source:CSFC-MSC-1.3.0-4e40e3d83708:p016:u004.s002> tdn:pdfPages "16" .
<urn:tdn:csfc:source:CSFC-MSC-1.3.0-4e40e3d83708:p016:u004.s002> tdn:sourceText "Two Inner Encryption Components for networks of different security levels will be unable to mutually authenticate with each other because they trust different CAs that do not have a trust relationship with one another or they use different CAKs that will not provide authentication." .
<urn:tdn:csfc:source:CSFC-MSC-1.3.0-4e40e3d83708:p017:f05:label006> rdfs:label "CSFC-MSC-1.3.0-4e40e3d83708:p017:f05:label006" .
<urn:tdn:csfc:source:CSFC-MSC-1.3.0-4e40e3d83708:p017:f05:label006> tdn:pdfPages "17" .
<urn:tdn:csfc:source:CSFC-MSC-1.3.0-4e40e3d83708:p017:f05:label006> tdn:sourceText "Inner Encryption Component" .
<urn:tdn:csfc:source:CSFC-MSC-1.3.0-4e40e3d83708:p017:f05:label007> rdfs:label "CSFC-MSC-1.3.0-4e40e3d83708:p017:f05:label007" .
<urn:tdn:csfc:source:CSFC-MSC-1.3.0-4e40e3d83708:p017:f05:label007> tdn:pdfPages "17" .
