<urn:tdn:csfc:source:CSFC-MSC-1.3.0-4e40e3d83708:p017:f05:label011> tdn:sourceText "Outer Encryption Component" .
<urn:tdn:csfc:source:CSFC-MSC-1.3.0-4e40e3d83708:p017:f05:label012> rdfs:label "CSFC-MSC-1.3.0-4e40e3d83708:p017:f05:label012" .
<urn:tdn:csfc:source:CSFC-MSC-1.3.0-4e40e3d83708:p017:f05:label012> tdn:pdfPages "17" .
<urn:tdn:csfc:source:CSFC-MSC-1.3.0-4e40e3d83708:p017:f05:label012> tdn:sourceText "Gray Management Services" .
<urn:tdn:csfc:source:CSFC-MSC-1.3.0-4e40e3d83708:p017:f05:label015> rdfs:label "CSFC-MSC-1.3.0-4e40e3d83708:p017:f05:label015" .
<urn:tdn:csfc:source:CSFC-MSC-1.3.0-4e40e3d83708:p017:f05:label015> tdn:pdfPages "17" .
<urn:tdn:csfc:source:CSFC-MSC-1.3.0-4e40e3d83708:p017:f05:label015> tdn:sourceText "Inner Encryption Component" .
<urn:tdn:csfc:source:CSFC-MSC-1.3.0-4e40e3d83708:p017:f05:label017> rdfs:label "CSFC-MSC-1.3.0-4e40e3d83708:p017:f05:label017" .
<urn:tdn:csfc:source:CSFC-MSC-1.3.0-4e40e3d83708:p017:f05:label017> tdn:pdfPages "17" .
<urn:tdn:csfc:source:CSFC-MSC-1.3.0-4e40e3d83708:p017:f05:label017> tdn:sourceText "Inner Encryption Component" .
<urn:tdn:csfc:source:CSFC-MSC-1.3.0-4e40e3d83708:p017:f05:label018> rdfs:label "CSFC-MSC-1.3.0-4e40e3d83708:p017:f05:label018" .
<urn:tdn:csfc:source:CSFC-MSC-1.3.0-4e40e3d83708:p017:f05:label018> tdn:pdfPages "17" .
<urn:tdn:csfc:source:CSFC-MSC-1.3.0-4e40e3d83708:p017:f05:label018> tdn:sourceText "Outer Encryption Component" .
<urn:tdn:csfc:source:CSFC-MSC-1.3.0-4e40e3d83708:p017:u005.s002> rdfs:label "CSFC-MSC-1.3.0-4e40e3d83708:p017:u005.s002" .
<urn:tdn:csfc:source:CSFC-MSC-1.3.0-4e40e3d83708:p017:u005.s002> tdn:pdfPages "17" .
<urn:tdn:csfc:source:CSFC-MSC-1.3.0-4e40e3d83708:p017:u005.s002> tdn:sourceText "Any physical path through a Gray Network between multiple Inner Encryption Components supporting Red Networks of different security levels must include at least one filtering component." .
<urn:tdn:csfc:source:CSFC-MSC-1.3.0-4e40e3d83708:p017:u006.s001> rdfs:label "CSFC-MSC-1.3.0-4e40e3d83708:p017:u006.s001" .
<urn:tdn:csfc:source:CSFC-MSC-1.3.0-4e40e3d83708:p017:u006.s001> tdn:pdfPages "17" .
<urn:tdn:csfc:source:CSFC-MSC-1.3.0-4e40e3d83708:p017:u006.s001> tdn:sourceText "When multiple security levels are used, it is critical to enforce proper IP address assignment and firewall rule sets." .
<urn:tdn:csfc:source:CSFC-MSC-1.3.0-4e40e3d83708:p017:u006.s002> rdfs:label "CSFC-MSC-1.3.0-4e40e3d83708:p017:u006.s002" .
<urn:tdn:csfc:source:CSFC-MSC-1.3.0-4e40e3d83708:p017:u006.s002> tdn:pdfPages "17" .
<urn:tdn:csfc:source:CSFC-MSC-1.3.0-4e40e3d83708:p017:u006.s002> tdn:sourceText "The IP address assigned must be unique to that security level such that each network’s Inner Encryption Component is only able to send and receive traffic to its respective Inner Encryption Component at the other site." .
<urn:tdn:csfc:source:CSFC-MSC-1.3.0-4e40e3d83708:p018:f06:label006> rdfs:label "CSFC-MSC-1.3.0-4e40e3d83708:p018:f06:label006" .
<urn:tdn:csfc:source:CSFC-MSC-1.3.0-4e40e3d83708:p018:f06:label006> tdn:pdfPages "18" .
<urn:tdn:csfc:source:CSFC-MSC-1.3.0-4e40e3d83708:p018:f06:label006> tdn:sourceText "Inner Encryption Component" .
<urn:tdn:csfc:source:CSFC-MSC-1.3.0-4e40e3d83708:p018:f06:label007> rdfs:label "CSFC-MSC-1.3.0-4e40e3d83708:p018:f06:label007" .
<urn:tdn:csfc:source:CSFC-MSC-1.3.0-4e40e3d83708:p018:f06:label007> tdn:pdfPages "18" .
<urn:tdn:csfc:source:CSFC-MSC-1.3.0-4e40e3d83708:p018:f06:label007> tdn:sourceText "Red Management Services" .
